{
  "signature_voices": [
    {
      "text": "呼！果然映影还是要到歌剧院看才有意思！",
      "source_file": "vo_SDNLQ004_10_furina_01.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3872
    },
    {
      "text": "首先，在观众的倒计时开始之时，林尼就来到了地道之中。",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ003_33_furina_01.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5249
    },
    {
      "text": "可是当水真的涨上来的时候，「水神」无动于衷。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ002_3_furina_08.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4960
    },
    {
      "text": "估计观众也没见过这么逼真的道具吧。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_10_furina_05.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 2408
    },
    {
      "text": "啊啊，快到歌剧院演出的时间了呢，再会啦。",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ303_3_furina_16.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4053
    },
    {
      "text": "（是剧情演出啊…呼…那我放心多了。）",
      "source_file": "vo_CLLQ003_12_furina_05.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4440
    },
    {
      "text": "在审判前，先容许我问一句…",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_4_furina_18.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 2550
    },
    {
      "text": "审判吗…真令人兴奋又期待啊。",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_2_furina_17.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4558
    },
    {
      "text": "你看，你们也没办法证明神明就不会受到原始胎海水的影响吧？",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_8_furina_12.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5150
    },
    {
      "text": "更何况，这些审判没有一场是「我所期待的」…",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_4_furina_02.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4879
    },
    {
      "text": "嗯，但我已经决定再也不登台演出了。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ001_2_furina_16.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3771
    },
    {
      "text": "就连异国的神明我都可以审判，呵呵呵…",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ001_5_furina_25.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3933
    },
    {
      "text": "不要把舞台演出和剧团里的关系混为一谈行吗？",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_4_furina_03.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3129
    },
    {
      "text": "那你们说，如果我不是神明，那真正的水神又在哪里？",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_7_furina_17.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4526
    },
    {
      "text": "你…确定要和神明进行决斗吗？",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_4_furina_03.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3431
    },
    {
      "text": "（不行…这样又会被怀疑，必须扮演枫丹民众想象中的神明。）",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_3_furina_23a.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5335
    },
    {
      "text": "「相信舞台上的芙宁娜便好，那就是你们应该信任的形象。」",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ002_3_furina_18.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5260
    },
    {
      "text": "扮演…神明？",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_2_furina_13.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 2080
    },
    {
      "text": "…但这种结局还是太残酷，并且对观众也有点不负责任。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ002_4_furina_08.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4438
    },
    {
      "text": "想要借歌剧院一用，情况是这样的…",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_7_furina_03.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 2843
    },
    {
      "text": "他们发挥得很好，我很久没看过这么漂亮的演出了。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_9_furina_01.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4171
    },
    {
      "text": "那么，我扮演水神的事，要到什么时候才算结束呢？",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_2_furina_16.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4786
    },
    {
      "text": "嗯，也要把演出顺利结束的消息告诉她…",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_10_furina_06.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3374
    },
    {
      "text": "（不过，再次站上这个舞台的感觉…）",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_9_furina_14.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3355
    },
    {
      "text": "（对了，「镜子里的我」说…我只要扮演人类想象中的神明…）",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ306_3_furina_11.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5938
    },
    {
      "text": "真正的水神，哪儿有这种东西…",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_7_furina_04.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 3316
    },
    {
      "text": "我，芙宁娜，将会在这场审判中诠释真正的「正义」！",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_4_furina_12.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5704
    },
    {
      "text": "那你们就把演出相关的事做到最好，我去帮你们安排舞台。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_6_furina_07.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4001
    },
    {
      "text": "如果说神明的礼物是一只眼睛…",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ003_11_furina_16.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 2465
    },
    {
      "text": "对不起各位，我没能守护住白淞镇的人们…我理应接受审判。",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ304_4_furina_09.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5531
    },
    {
      "text": "没错，假如二位没有异议，我将以水神的名义批捕你们。",
      "source_file": "vo_FDAQ001_5_furina_19.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5974
    },
    {
      "text": "现在演出的阻碍都在一个个被解决，也是时候把他们找回来了。",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ001_4_furina_07.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4684
    },
    {
      "text": "「正义守护者」？难道是二十年前那位活跃于夜晚的侠客吗？",
      "source_file": "vo_CLLQ002_21_furina_10.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 4828
    },
    {
      "text": "最后的演出，不光是你们的谢幕，应该也是献给她最后的礼物吧？",
      "source_file": "vo_FNNLQ001_3_furina_18.wem",
      "category": "其他",
      "duration_ms": 5864
    }
  ]
}